  "discussion": "The use of designated cable colours can provide an easy way to distinguish SECRET and TOP SECRET systems from other systems. For example, while SECRET and TOP SECRET cables have designated colours, cables for other systems may be any colour except for those reserved for SECRET and TOP SECRET systems. In addition, cable colours for other systems may be the same colour, such as blue.",
